# Template sync manifest (ADR 0069). Read by scripts/template-sync.ps1.
# Paths a game takes from roblox-game-template. Everything else belongs to the game.
# Syntax: one glob per line, relative to the repo root. `*` stays inside a folder, `**` crosses folders.
# A leading `!` excludes. Lines starting with `#` are comments. The last matching line wins.
# A game adds its own exclusions in `.templatesync.local` (same syntax, only `!` lines matter there).
# Files the template lacks are reported, never deleted in the game.

# Tooling and gates
scripts/**
!scripts/new-game.ps1
!scripts/new-game.test.ps1
!scripts/suites.luau
.githooks/**
tools/**
!tools/board.issue
.luaurc
.styluaignore
stylua.toml
selene.toml
.gitattributes

# Team workflow
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/**
.github/pull_request_template.md
.github/release.yml
.github/labels.json
.github/workflows/**
!.github/workflows/template-sync-run.yml
!.github/workflows/template-sync-notify.yml

# Rules and molds that carry no game content
docs/RULES.md
docs/agent-loop.md
docs/live-vs-branches.md
docs/ui-system.md
docs/win-condition-checklist.md
docs/game/README.md
docs/game/grill.md
